    "title": "D3力导向图及树状布局变换",
    "comment": {
      "commentId": 17239608,
      "articleId": 78083701,
      "parentId": 0,
      "postTime": "2021-06-28 14:24:08",
      "content": "朋友你这个是深度优先 ，下面这个是广度优先\n[code=javascript]\n// 广度算法\n            function BFSTree(nodes, lis, data) {\n                nodes = nodes.constructor === Array ? nodes : [nodes];\n                for (let i = 0; i &lt; nodes.length; i++) {\n                    let node = nodes[i];\n                    for (let link of data.links) {\n                        node.children = node.children ? node.children : []\n                        if (link.source.index === link.target.index) continue;\n                        if (link.source.index === node.index || link.target.index === node.index) {\n                            if (lis.indexOf(link.target.index) === -1) {\n                                lis.push(link.target.index);\n                                node.children.push(link.target);\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                    if (node.children) {\n                        BFSTree(node.children, lis, data)\n                    }\n                }\n\n[/code]",
